# {{ .Name }} ({{ .Type }})

> **Business Edition only.** This endpoint does not exist in Portainer CE.

Reads the parsed X.509 details of the mTLS certificate whose rejection is keeping an environment's agent from connecting.

## Example Usage

```hcl
data "portainer_endpoint_mtls_certificate_error" "agent" {
  endpoint_id = portainer_endpoint_trust.shop_floor_3.endpoint_id
}

output "rejected_certificate_expiry" {
  value = data.portainer_endpoint_mtls_certificate_error.agent.valid_not_after
}
```

{{ .SchemaMarkdown | trimspace }}

## Attributes Reference

An environment that has never presented a certificate reports `configured = false` with every other attribute empty, rather than failing the plan. A call that fails for any other reason still fails.
